<h2>Price / Billing</h2>
<p>
	I am currently in the process of credentialing with additional insurance
	providers. I also work with clients without billing insurance, referred to
	as "self-pay". You may be able to use your "out of
	network" benefits even if I do not take your insurance. For self-pay
	clients, I can offer a sliding scale rate based on income and other factors.
</p>

<p>I am in network with the following insurance companies:</p>
<ul>
	<li>Aetna</li>
</ul>

<h3>Rates</h3>
<ul>
	<li>Individual therapy: $175/hr</li>
	<li>Family therapy: $200/hr</li>
</ul>
<p>
	If you are not going through insurance, otherwise known as
	"self-pay", I offer a sliding scale.
</p>

<hr class="service-divider">

